; Crate Lab - 40 original levels for Game Lab
; Authored by ibra-kdbra with the help of Sokoban/tools/design.mjs (reverse search
; from the solved position) and checked by Sokoban/tools/verify-levels.mjs.
; Licensed with the rest of the repository.
;
; Standard XSB: # wall, @ player, + player on goal, $ crate, * crate on goal, . goal.
; Each map is followed by Title, World, Par (optimal pushes) and Idea.

